BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_314855921@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260523T035659Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260523T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260523T163000
SUMMARY:10 Brew time!
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nIt’s time again for our annual 10 Brew ru
 n. We’ll be startingng from Hi Wire RAD again meeting at 11:30 am and le
 aving as a group at 11:45 am. We’ll have 5 stops between the start and f
 inish. You’re welcome to run the whole thing\, part of it\, on none (you
  can just meet up at stops and have a beer with us).\n\nIt’s a casuall r
 un and we stay together. Bring sunscreen\, a hat and your plucky spirit an
 d sense off adventure! *$10/person suggested donation to Travis for our Me
 et Up dues\, either in cash or Venmo @Travis-Edwards-81. More details at r
 un group on Tuesday.*\n\nWe hope to see you there!\n\n**START**\n**Hi Wire
  RAD - 11:45 AM**\nRIGHT\nOut of Hi Wire\nSTRAIGHT\nLyman St\nLEFT\nCraven
  St\nSTAY LEFT\nCraven St\nRIGHT\nWaynesville\nLEFT\nShort Michigan\nLEFT\
 nHaywood Rd\n**STOP #1**\n**Archetype (Leg=2.1 miles)**\n\nRIGHT\nOut of A
 rchetype\nRIGHT\nWellington St\nLEFT\nState Street\nLEFT\nJoyner\nRIGHT\nR
 iverview\nLEFT\nAmboy Road and over bridge\nSTRAIGHT THEN LEFT\nCross Lyma
 n Street then left on sidewalk\n**STOP #2**\n**Hi Wire RAD (Leg= 2.5 miles
 )**\n\nRIGHT\nOut of Hi Wire\nRIGHT\nLyman St at traffic circle\nLEFT\nCli
 ngman Ave\nRIGHT\nHaywood Rd\nRIGHT\nHilliard Ave\nRIGHT\nCoxe Ave\nLEFT\n
 Buxton Ave\nRIGHT\nCollier Ave\n**STOP #3**\n**Burial (Leg= 1.4 miles)**\n
 \nRIGHT\nOut of Burial\nRIGHT\nBuxton Ave\nLEFT\nChurch Street\nRIGHT\nHil
 liard Ave\nSTRAIGHT\nBiltmore Ave\nRIGHT\nS. Beaumont Ave\nLEFT\nS.. Charl
 otte St\nSTRAIGHT\nCollege St\nSTRAIGHT\nI-240\n**STOP #4**\n**Charlotte S
 treet Pub (Leg=1.6 miles)**\n\nLEFT\nOut of pub onto Charlotte St\nRIGHT\n
 Broad St\nLEFT\nMadison Ave\nRIGHT\nChestnut\nLEFT\nCentral\nRIGHT\nWoodfi
 n\nLEFT\nLexington Ave\n**STOP #5**\n**DSSOLVR (Leg=.9 miles)**\n\nRIGHT\n
 Out of Dssolvr on to Lexington\nRIGHT\nCollege Street\nLEFT\nClingman Ave\
 nLEFT\nClingman Ave @ Grey Eagle\nSTRAIGHT\nLyman Street at Traffic Circle
 \nLEFT\nLyman Street at Traffic Circle\n**FINISH**\n**Hi Wire RAD (Leg=1.3
  miles)**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/314855921/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260519T023836Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260519T023836Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_314753187@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260523T035659Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260526T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260526T201500
SUMMARY:Tuesday Brewsday Wedge at Foundation
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nLike a Phoenix rising from the ashes\, so h
 as the Wedge at Foundation been reborn from the devastation of Hurricane H
 elene!\nWe're back to celebrate their return and support this wonderful br
 ewery. We'll have a new route since the old one is no more. But it should 
 provide be just as fun.\nCome on out and enjoy this West Asheville run.\n\
 nNew Wedge\n3.3 miles\nL on Lyman\nonto Greenway\nturn around at Amboy\nSt
 ay on Greenway to\nCraven\nturn around\nStay on Greenway\nback to brewery\
 n\nNew Wedge\n5.0 miles\nL on Lyman\nonto Greenway\nR on Amboy\nR on River
 view\nSharp L on Joyner\nR on State\nR on Michigan\nR on Montana\nL on Swa
 nnanoa\nR on Haywood\nStay L on Haywood\nL on Craven\nR on Riverside\nStay
  R on Lyman\nback to brewery
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/314753187/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260512T140534Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260512T140534Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_312835133@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260523T035659Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260528T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260528T200000
SUMMARY:Thursday Run 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nCome run 1\, 3\, or 6 miles and stay for a 
 beer and soccer tennis after at Olde London Road.\n\nRoutes-\n1 miler:\nRI
 GHT out of OLR parking lot\nContinue around roundabout at Clingman\, and h
 ead toward the river on Lyman St.\nRIGHT on River Arts Place\nCross Rivers
 ide onto the Greenway\nRight on the Greenway to the Craven St Park put in 
 (the dock)\nTurn around and go back the same way to OLR\n\n3 miler:\nStart
  the same as 1 miler\nContinue onto Craven St. Bridge\nLEFT onto Greenway 
 after bridge\nFollow Greenway all the way until it ends at Haywood Rd.\nRI
 GHT onto Haywood Rd\, go across the bridge\nCross the Roundabout at Robert
 s St. and continue onto Clingman\nContinue on Clingman\nLEFT onto Owens Be
 ll Lane\nLEFT onto Hilliard at the top of the hill\nLEFT onto W Haywood\, 
 follow all the way down to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts\nFollow Roberts back
  to OLR\nPass OLR to Bartlett\, turn around and come back to OLR\n\n6 mile
 r:\nAfter the W Haywood downhill to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts St. take to
  Lyman and head back to the Greenway\nLEFT onto the Greenway\, take all th
 e way to Amboy\nRIGHT on Amboy to cross the bridge\nRIGHT into French Broa
 d River Park\, run the loop at the park\nCross back over the bridge on Amb
 oy and run the Greenway back to the roundabout\nFollow Lyman back to OLR
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/312835133/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260111T194430Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260111T194430Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
